{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Drunken Beard, you take the reins of a lively tavern where every pint tells a story. Brew craft beers, manage orders between thirsty dwarves and impatient adventurers, expand the inn and turn it into a legendary haven. Between secret recipes, rustic furnishings, and demanding customers, only the finest innkeeper will win over hearts and livers. Glory awaits\u2026 one beer at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Build.gif?t=1748094672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physically shape and expand your tavern and progress your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Craft.gif?t=1748094672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting is the beating heart of &quot;The Drunken Beard&quot;, where fast-paced fun meets the satisfaction of building a thriving dwarven enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Customize.gif?t=1748094672\" />Choose your favorite character, male or female, and customize it as you like.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Clean_new.gif?t=1748094672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all customers are good customers! Sometimes they can make your tavern look terrible. Keep your tavern clean to increase customer approval.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622810?t=1748094672","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622810?t=1748094672","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/f49b88a38a3b5d34e2142f27787332a5f89fa3c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748094672","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/f49b88a38a3b5d34e2142f27787332a5f89fa3c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748094672","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3646870,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Drunken Beard, you take the reins of a lively tavern where every pint tells a story. Brew craft beers, manage orders between thirsty dwarves and impatient adventurers, expand the inn and turn it into a legendary haven. Between secret recipes, rustic furnishings, and demanding customers, only the finest innkeeper will win over hearts and livers. Glory awaits\u2026 one beer at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Build.gif?t=1748094672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physically shape and expand your tavern and progress your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Craft.gif?t=1748094672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crafting is the beating heart of &quot;The Drunken Beard&quot;, where fast-paced fun meets the satisfaction of building a thriving dwarven enterprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Customize.gif?t=1748094672\" />Choose your favorite character, male or female, and customize it as you like.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622810/extras/GIF_Clean_new.gif?t=1748094672\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not all customers are good customers! Sometimes they can make your tave